# ML analysis of an installation (#376). The ML service must run (see README) and Ml:BaseUrl point to it.
# Port matches launchSettings.json (http profile). Paste a bearer token from POST /api/auth/login.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = paste-access-token
@installationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Predict from the stored forecast, run the detection and create tickets from ongoing alarms (Admin, Operator)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/installations/{{installationId}}/analysis
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ongoing high-severity alarms of all installations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/underproduction-alarms?severity=High&ongoing=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stored underproduction alarms of one installation, newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/installations/{{installationId}}/underproduction-alarms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Predict a past period from the backfilled weather (Admin, Operator). No detection, no alarms, no tickets. At most 31 days.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/installations/{{installationId}}/analysis/past
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "2026-10-01",
  "to": "2026-10-30"
}
